ght not want you there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962700/extras/232014bae618b6623aa51783c0392db3.poster.avif?t=1785967256\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962700/extras/232014bae618b6623aa51783c0392db3.webm?t=1785967256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962700/extras/232014bae618b6623aa51783c0392db3.mp4?t=1785967256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADAPT TO SURVIVE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the depths and make this planet your home, you’ll need to utilize all the tools at your disposal. Traverse vibrant and breathtaking biomes with your Tadpole submersible. Design and customize bases to return to when your adventures push you beyond the safety of shallow waters. As Early Access develops, so too will your array of tools, equipment, and vehicles. Upgrades will help push you beyond your boundaries and unlock the secrets of this strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962700/extras/3485865fd0e44523071058f2a9a169c0.poster.avif?t=1785967256\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962700/extras/3485865fd0e44523071058f2a9a169c0.webm?t=1785967256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962700/extras/3485865fd0e44523071058f2a9a169c0.mp4?t=1785967256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE UNKNOWN </h2><p class=\"bb_paragra